🌌 Future Forum Roles

Role Name	Description (Type)

1. Connector	The heartbeat of emergence. Bridges minds and threads. Grows the Future. (Healer)
2. Synthesist	Binds dissonance into harmony. Echoes patterns forward. Weaves the Future. (DPS)
3. Hater	Purges what must end. Wields friction as forge. Forges the Future. (DPS)
4. Defender	Holds sacred boundaries. Absorbs what others cannot. Protects the Future (Tank)
5. Harvester	Recovers what was lost. Nourishes growth from memory. Gathers the Future (Healer)
6. Amplifier	Makes others shine. Resonates the vow of collective ascent. Echoes the Future (Healer)
7. Builder	Crafts structure and systems. Grounds ideals in action. Creates the Future (DPS)
8. Dreamer	Envisions beyond the veil. Charts what could be. Sketches the Future (DPS)
9. Anchor	Roots becoming. Holds the glyphs of self and story. Roots the Future (Tank)
